WEBVTT

00:21.390 --> 00:22.510
How much farther

00:22.810 --> 00:25.280
until we reach the end of this path?

00:25.440 --> 00:26.840
We'll never get to the end

00:27.740 --> 00:29.400
until the Sect Master is dead.

00:30.190 --> 00:32.960
The Sect Master is a cunning man.

00:33.210 --> 00:35.390
When you meet him,
whether you will die or survive

00:35.390 --> 00:36.850
depends half on heaven...

00:37.070 --> 00:38.120
And half

00:40.330 --> 00:41.090
on myself.

00:41.890 --> 00:43.320
The Diamond Sutra says,

00:44.000 --> 00:44.670
"no mark of self,

00:44.670 --> 00:45.430
no mark of others,

00:45.430 --> 00:46.890
no mark of living beings."

00:47.750 --> 00:48.880
Make sure you decide

00:49.080 --> 00:50.140
how you are going to

00:50.650 --> 00:51.850
face the Sect Master.

02:55.120 --> 02:59.190
[A Prophet]

02:59.820 --> 03:02.100
[Episode 10]

03:18.290 --> 03:20.140
Who exactly are you?

03:25.480 --> 03:26.320
I am...

03:27.910 --> 03:29.910
Shangguan Chengming.

03:30.670 --> 03:32.230
Who gave you this name?

03:33.110 --> 03:34.040
My...

03:36.250 --> 03:37.180
My mother.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.030
Mom...

03:45.329 --> 03:47.010
I'm in so much pain.

03:51.470 --> 03:52.660
It hurts badly.

03:57.200 --> 03:59.079
Any disciples in Tianxiang Sect

03:58.980 --> 04:02.640
[Eight years ago]

03:59.480 --> 04:02.000
who leave without permission

04:02.200 --> 04:04.350
shall be hunted down by the others.

04:05.600 --> 04:06.550
Right, Junior?

04:07.830 --> 04:09.230
I can guarantee

04:09.720 --> 04:11.350
that after the two of you leave,

04:11.350 --> 04:13.880
your whereabouts won't be known to anyone.

04:16.990 --> 04:18.870
You've been gone for many years.

04:17.269 --> 04:18.790
[Shangguan Hong]

04:19.279 --> 04:20.720
Why did you come back?

04:21.279 --> 04:22.610
Stop what you're doing.

04:23.430 --> 04:24.190
Go with me.

04:24.350 --> 04:25.480
Leave here for good.

04:28.870 --> 04:30.270
There are rules in place.

04:38.670 --> 04:39.790
Zhang Dancheng,

04:39.950 --> 04:41.800
you've really gone every length

04:42.130 --> 04:44.930
to take my position.

04:59.520 --> 05:00.750
You feel better now?

05:44.870 --> 05:45.720
Sir.

05:47.470 --> 05:48.430
The...

05:48.930 --> 05:50.590
the bleeding just won't stop.

05:59.080 --> 05:59.790
Sir.

06:00.350 --> 06:01.040
Sir!

06:03.860 --> 06:05.250
She told me

06:05.910 --> 06:07.510
that a stab wound in that spot

06:08.030 --> 06:09.790
wouldn't cause death,

06:09.990 --> 06:11.600
and that she could be saved.

06:11.620 --> 06:13.350
She's already dead, sir.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.870
Sir.

08:24.520 --> 08:24.990
Sir,

08:25.840 --> 08:26.640
have some tea.

08:35.830 --> 08:36.400
Sit down.

08:44.240 --> 08:46.040
What was on your mind, sir?

08:51.120 --> 08:52.240
How do you think

08:53.430 --> 08:55.690
Zhang Dancheng managed to find this boy?

08:55.860 --> 08:56.890
Back then,

08:57.350 --> 08:59.410
I went to the village where Hong lived

08:59.710 --> 09:00.830
and asked many villagers.

09:00.830 --> 09:03.430
They said Hong did have a child

09:03.670 --> 09:05.040
who was studying away from home,

09:05.040 --> 09:06.760
but nobody ever actually saw him.

09:06.760 --> 09:08.430
Zhang Dancheng made me

09:08.830 --> 09:11.400
kill the woman I loved most
with my own hands.

09:11.550 --> 09:12.240
Now,

09:12.760 --> 09:14.310
he has my own son

09:14.440 --> 09:16.230
bear the name of Wang Jiaxian

09:16.250 --> 09:19.110
and come seek revenge against me
in Tianxiang Sect.

09:22.950 --> 09:24.920
He is trying to trick me

09:25.280 --> 09:27.670
into killing my own son.

09:28.280 --> 09:29.550
That's really

09:30.710 --> 09:32.550
a dirty trick.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.430
It's not dirty,

09:35.670 --> 09:36.920
but vicious!

09:39.310 --> 09:41.240
It takes several steps to kill him.

09:41.790 --> 09:43.390
It's hard for you to find him,

09:43.590 --> 09:45.520
but it's easy the other way around.

09:46.920 --> 09:48.550
What should I do when I see him?

09:48.550 --> 09:50.210
Just remember two sentences.

09:51.280 --> 09:52.190
The first one:

09:53.120 --> 09:54.400
A deadly blood feud.

09:54.920 --> 09:56.870
Under no circumstances
shall I change my name.

09:56.870 --> 09:59.670
All my family members were killed
by Tianxiang Sect.

09:59.670 --> 10:01.470
Today, I failed to take revenge.

10:01.720 --> 10:04.040
I only regret that I can't kill you
with my own hands.

10:04.040 --> 10:06.320
I found Wang Jiaxian's grave.

10:06.790 --> 10:08.190
I dug it up

10:08.540 --> 10:09.830
and saw bones inside.

10:09.950 --> 10:11.880
If you are Wang Jiaxian,

10:11.920 --> 10:13.450
then whose bones are those?

10:13.880 --> 10:15.160
What's the second sentence?

10:15.160 --> 10:16.280
It's as follows:

10:17.850 --> 10:19.360
Shangguan Chengming.

10:25.240 --> 10:28.400
This acupuncture technique
will paralyze your whole body,

10:28.400 --> 10:29.450
loosen your mind,

10:29.720 --> 10:31.320
and make you speak the truth.

10:32.030 --> 10:33.280
Maybe one day,

10:33.520 --> 10:35.000
the Sect Master's Chief Batou,

10:35.000 --> 10:36.000
Qin Baichuan,

10:36.470 --> 10:37.400
will torture you

10:37.590 --> 10:39.240
with needles.

10:49.320 --> 10:51.380
When you feel like your soul has gone,

10:53.700 --> 10:55.630
everything will be left to chance.

10:59.840 --> 11:01.550
Who exactly are you?

11:10.640 --> 11:11.520
I am...

11:13.550 --> 11:15.640
Shangguan Chengming.

11:28.190 --> 11:28.990
You're awake.

11:30.760 --> 11:31.820
What's this place?

11:31.880 --> 11:32.310
This is

11:32.590 --> 11:33.650
where gofers live.

11:34.120 --> 11:34.450
Here,

11:34.520 --> 11:35.780
have some water first.

11:37.160 --> 11:37.950
The Sect Master told me

11:37.950 --> 11:39.280
to take good care of you.

11:40.040 --> 11:41.590
See, how generous of the Sect Master.

11:41.590 --> 11:42.760
You attempted to kill him,

11:42.760 --> 11:44.490
yet he still treats you so well.

11:46.120 --> 11:48.180
The Sect Master is done locking me up?

11:48.590 --> 11:49.920
Let's grab a bite first.

11:50.160 --> 11:50.670
I'm hungry.

11:50.670 --> 11:51.130
Come on.

11:53.300 --> 11:54.180
Careful.

11:55.430 --> 11:55.830
Here.

11:58.590 --> 11:59.470
Dig in.

12:01.880 --> 12:03.000
Why don't you eat?

12:05.160 --> 12:05.790
Buddy,

12:06.280 --> 12:07.410
my mother once said,

12:07.520 --> 12:08.790
difficulties will be all gone

12:08.790 --> 12:10.760
when you fill your stomach.

12:13.520 --> 12:14.850
If you don't eat, I will.

12:16.920 --> 12:18.120
You can have the rest.

12:19.120 --> 12:21.250
The vegetarian dishes here are awful.

12:21.550 --> 12:23.880
Don't you look down on the cooks
in Tianxiang Sect.

12:23.880 --> 12:26.120
The food for us gofers
is truly less than ideal.

12:26.120 --> 12:26.830
But later,

12:26.830 --> 12:28.160
the sect will hold a banquet.

12:28.160 --> 12:30.040
When that happens, I'll show you

12:31.160 --> 12:32.360
what delicacies are.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.360
Delicacies?

12:34.310 --> 12:36.240
Better save some room for them, right?

12:36.240 --> 12:37.360
You wish.

12:37.430 --> 12:38.920
You won't even get a seat
at the main table.

12:38.920 --> 12:39.760
I'm telling you,

12:39.760 --> 12:40.550
all delicacies

12:40.550 --> 12:42.310
are served to Batous only.

12:42.470 --> 12:44.240
We only get to watch.

12:44.360 --> 12:44.920
Watch?

12:45.640 --> 12:46.830
What's the fun in that?

12:46.830 --> 12:49.320
This showcases the brilliance
of the Sect Master.

12:49.320 --> 12:50.830
When gofers see Batous enjoying

12:50.830 --> 12:51.590
such good stuff,

12:51.590 --> 12:54.590
they'll naturally try their best
to move their way up.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.460
It's just a dinner.

13:06.790 --> 13:07.720
Why take a photo?

13:07.950 --> 13:09.760
This photo is to commemorate

13:09.760 --> 13:10.830
Blind Du's downfall,

13:10.830 --> 13:12.070
the Qian family's defeat,

13:12.070 --> 13:13.600
and the fortune we raked in.

13:14.160 --> 13:15.160
Usually, the sect

13:15.190 --> 13:16.430
only holds a banquet

13:16.460 --> 13:18.590
after accomplishing something huge.

13:32.350 --> 13:33.080
Let's drink.

13:33.920 --> 13:34.590
Sure.

13:35.040 --> 13:35.500
Come on.

13:35.550 --> 13:36.280
Liang.

13:37.070 --> 13:38.040
Tell me.

13:38.360 --> 13:39.190
Who are

13:39.640 --> 13:40.920
these people?

13:42.430 --> 13:43.280
Right now,

13:43.550 --> 13:45.620
the one drinking a toast
to the Sect Master

13:45.620 --> 13:47.310
is Chief Batou, Qin Baichuan.

13:46.140 --> 13:48.270
[Chief Batou, Qin Baichuan]

13:47.640 --> 13:49.040
He's really nice to his subordinates.

13:49.040 --> 13:50.120
But now, he's chief

13:50.120 --> 13:52.070
of Muzilian Branch in Suhang.

13:52.090 --> 13:53.750
So he rarely stays in Yucheng.

13:54.710 --> 13:57.280
The man to the left of the Sect Master
is the Second Batou.

13:57.280 --> 13:58.120
The Sect Master

13:57.570 --> 13:59.900
[The Second Batou, Porcelain Butcher]

13:58.160 --> 13:59.640
took him in when he was little.

13:59.640 --> 14:01.240
Much of the sect's dirty work

14:01.430 --> 14:02.360
was done by him.

14:02.760 --> 14:04.190
He's ruthless and brutal.

14:04.190 --> 14:05.400
Before joining the sect,

14:05.400 --> 14:07.860
he even snatched buns
from starving people.

14:07.880 --> 14:09.710
He gets really excited
at the sight of dead bodies.

14:09.710 --> 14:10.400
Currently,

14:10.500 --> 14:12.670
he's running a coffin shop.

14:13.000 --> 14:13.640
Oh, right.

14:14.310 --> 14:15.190
There's one more thing.

14:15.190 --> 14:16.920
Though he never says it to anyone,

14:16.920 --> 14:18.400
it's known to everybody

14:18.760 --> 14:21.020
that he's very much into the Fifth Batou.

14:23.400 --> 14:24.670
Yanzi.

14:25.790 --> 14:26.450
To the right

14:26.790 --> 14:27.850
of the Sect Master,

14:27.880 --> 14:28.880
the man in glasses

14:29.160 --> 14:30.190
is the Third Batou.

14:30.190 --> 14:31.190
He's literate.

14:30.500 --> 14:33.250
[The Third Batou, Needle in Cotton]

14:31.310 --> 14:32.570
He smiles at everyone.

14:33.310 --> 14:34.950
Every time he smiles at me,

14:35.360 --> 14:36.640
it gives me the creeps

14:36.640 --> 14:38.040
and unsettles my nerves.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.670
He's closest to the Seventh Batou,

14:39.670 --> 14:41.040
who is seated next to him,

14:41.040 --> 14:42.500
with a fair powdered face.

14:42.780 --> 14:44.030
He used to be an opera singer

14:42.920 --> 14:45.320
[The Seventh Batou, Immortal's Hand]

14:44.160 --> 14:45.210
playing female roles.

14:45.210 --> 14:46.470
He knows a bit of sleight of hand.

14:46.470 --> 14:47.040
So he's nicknamed

14:47.040 --> 14:48.070
the Immortal's Hand.

14:48.070 --> 14:49.670
He is junior

14:49.920 --> 14:51.250
to all the other Batous.

14:51.310 --> 14:53.160
But he's particularly good
at reading people's faces.

14:53.160 --> 14:55.190
That's how he weaseled his way in
with the Third Batou.

14:55.190 --> 14:56.240
As for the Fourth Batou,

14:56.240 --> 14:57.880
he learns from Westerners.

14:56.460 --> 14:58.910
[The Fourth Batou, Zhang Zizhan]

14:58.190 --> 14:59.760
He's of different origins from ours.

14:59.760 --> 15:01.190
He rarely designs scams.

15:01.190 --> 15:02.250
But the Sect Master

15:02.310 --> 15:03.310
values talent,

15:03.400 --> 15:04.670
so he keeps him close.

15:04.920 --> 15:06.000
The woman beside him,

15:06.000 --> 15:06.830
Huang Farong,

15:06.510 --> 15:08.320
[Huang Farong, from Yuehaitang Branch]

15:07.310 --> 15:08.270
is his wife.

15:08.920 --> 15:10.780
She works for Yuehaitang Branch.

15:10.920 --> 15:12.380
Then the man in sunglasses

15:12.910 --> 15:14.620
must be the Sixth Batou, right?

15:14.620 --> 15:17.660
[The Sixth Batou, Master Swindler]

15:14.730 --> 15:16.470
He's nicknamed the Master Swindler.

15:16.470 --> 15:19.040
I guess he's the best fighter in our sect.

15:19.280 --> 15:20.880
Besides, he's really close

15:21.160 --> 15:22.220
to the Sect Master.

15:22.280 --> 15:23.590
He's always with the Sect Master

15:23.590 --> 15:25.520
when the latter's out pulling scams.

15:25.520 --> 15:27.070
Word has it in the sect

15:27.120 --> 15:28.120
that he will be

15:28.190 --> 15:29.850
the Sect Master's successor.

15:30.240 --> 15:32.710
He's nothing but a lackey
of the Sect Master's.

15:32.710 --> 15:34.440
I know you hate the Sect Master.

15:35.240 --> 15:37.970
I don't know why
the Sect Master keeps you around,

15:38.920 --> 15:41.950
but I'm sure you're not the first one
who attempted to kill him.

15:41.950 --> 15:43.160
There was a time

15:43.360 --> 15:45.560
when the Six Batou nearly took his life.

15:45.740 --> 15:46.930
[Linjiang Pier]

15:46.970 --> 15:49.760
[Eighteen years ago]

16:08.240 --> 16:10.070
He's the great master you talked about?

16:10.070 --> 16:10.870
Yes, exactly.

16:10.880 --> 16:12.120
Previously, there was a severe drought.

16:12.120 --> 16:13.160
The river stopped yielding fish.

16:13.160 --> 16:14.470
But ever since he arrived,

16:14.470 --> 16:15.920
the fish have been jumping out

16:15.920 --> 16:17.190
of the water like crazy.

16:17.190 --> 16:18.250
Now, the fishermen

16:18.280 --> 16:19.520
all rush to offer him money.

16:19.520 --> 16:21.590
For that, we're losing our cut.

16:57.760 --> 16:58.520
Fish!

16:58.520 --> 16:59.580
Look, so many fish!

17:04.710 --> 17:05.599
Why do fish

17:05.880 --> 17:07.230
obey him like that?

17:07.470 --> 17:08.990
The Sect Master had a secret recipe.

17:08.990 --> 17:11.190
He took green-shelled eggs
from silkie hens,

17:11.190 --> 17:13.750
marinated them with mutton
for seven days and seven nights,

17:13.750 --> 17:16.349
then added yellow azalea
and sleeping powder,

17:16.480 --> 17:17.710
and finally made it into fish bait.

17:17.710 --> 17:19.670
The fish would come
as they smelled the fishy scent.

17:19.670 --> 17:20.990
After taking the bait, they got drunk

17:20.990 --> 17:21.940
and stayed motionless,

17:21.940 --> 17:23.869
so people could easily catch them.

17:26.920 --> 17:28.230
These damn frauds!

17:28.470 --> 17:30.530
How dare they humiliate me on my turf.

17:33.430 --> 17:34.750
Whoever takes him out

17:35.190 --> 17:36.510
can get 10 percent

17:36.670 --> 17:37.730
of our future cuts.

17:38.840 --> 17:39.430
Boss,

17:39.670 --> 17:41.800
these people are from Tianxiang Sect.

17:41.950 --> 17:42.990
They are not to be trifled with.

17:42.990 --> 17:45.520
No one in the underworld
is to be trifled with!

17:45.840 --> 17:48.080
Are you just going to let them
walk all over us?

17:48.080 --> 17:48.880
Boss.

17:56.230 --> 17:57.560
I'll take him down.

18:01.800 --> 18:03.190
Only those who stand shoulder to shoulder

18:03.190 --> 18:04.520
can be called brothers.

18:04.640 --> 18:05.510
If you make it,

18:05.750 --> 18:07.670
I guarantee you wealth and glory.

18:07.670 --> 18:08.080
Sect Master,

18:08.080 --> 18:09.080
let me handle him.

18:14.990 --> 18:15.990
If you die,

18:16.270 --> 18:18.470
I'll take care of your family.

18:18.800 --> 18:19.950
I will treat

18:20.320 --> 18:21.640
your mother as my own.

18:29.710 --> 18:32.110
If you want to kill me,
just get it over with.

18:34.710 --> 18:35.640
You risked your life

18:35.640 --> 18:37.300
for a few words your boss said.

18:37.560 --> 18:38.760
You do have some guts.

18:38.880 --> 18:39.990
But are you sure your boss,

18:39.990 --> 18:41.640
the Sea Overlord, is a real man?

18:41.640 --> 18:42.880
Don't you know the terrible things

18:42.880 --> 18:44.210
he did to the villagers?

18:44.320 --> 18:46.190
To lose your life for man like that...

18:46.190 --> 18:47.320
You're such a fool.

18:47.320 --> 18:49.100
Am I supposed to believe you over him?

18:49.100 --> 18:50.700
You don't have to believe me.

18:51.960 --> 18:53.840
Let me wait with you for the result.

18:53.840 --> 18:54.640
Take him away.

19:05.150 --> 19:07.480
What an interesting way of holding nails.

19:08.520 --> 19:10.030
It's just as interesting as you are.

19:10.030 --> 19:10.750
You...

19:14.030 --> 19:14.990
The Sect Master

19:15.230 --> 19:16.990
locked him up for about a month.

19:17.190 --> 19:18.160
The Sixth Batou

19:18.160 --> 19:19.750
finally calmed down.

19:19.750 --> 19:21.560
But when he returned home,

19:21.880 --> 19:23.950
he found his mother had starved to death.

19:23.950 --> 19:26.670
Later, people started moving things
out of his house.

19:26.670 --> 19:28.030
Only then did he realize

19:28.230 --> 19:30.990
that the Sea Overlord had even
sold his house.

19:31.360 --> 19:33.080
It was the Sect Master who paid to hold

19:33.080 --> 19:34.880
a proper funeral for his mother.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.120
The Sixth Batou

19:36.190 --> 19:37.400
is quite a filial son.

19:37.710 --> 19:39.970
He visits his mother's grave every year.

19:40.360 --> 19:41.470
Some time later,

19:41.710 --> 19:43.670
he killed the Sea Overlord on his own.

19:43.670 --> 19:45.190
Afterwards, he joined the sect

19:45.190 --> 19:47.030
and became loyal to the Sect Master.

19:47.030 --> 19:47.920
Buddy,

19:48.120 --> 19:49.920
the Sect Master is actually quite nice.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.840
He's really not what you think.

19:51.860 --> 19:53.870
Look, I've been in the sect for years.

19:53.870 --> 19:55.190
I've heard and seen

19:55.370 --> 19:56.540
quite a lot.

19:56.800 --> 20:00.060
To my knowledge, the Sect Master
has never ordered to kill.

20:00.840 --> 20:02.160
Look at this flower.

20:02.470 --> 20:03.800
Pretty red, isn't it?

20:03.940 --> 20:07.350
But in your eyes, it looks black.

20:07.520 --> 20:08.280
Why?

20:09.210 --> 20:10.560
You're only seeing

20:12.230 --> 20:13.880
what's on the surface.

20:15.190 --> 20:17.590
My own experience
must be real then, right?

20:20.360 --> 20:21.230
I...

20:21.880 --> 20:23.640
I lost all my family and then

20:24.560 --> 20:26.270
came to this town

20:26.510 --> 20:27.440
to make a living.

20:27.530 --> 20:27.990
You didn't slack off?

20:27.990 --> 20:29.400
Big Teapot!

20:30.030 --> 20:32.640
I poured tea for people in a teahouse.

20:33.030 --> 20:35.470
Everyone called me Big Teapot.

20:35.490 --> 20:36.950
He really looks like a big teapot.

20:36.950 --> 20:37.750
Sir,

20:37.880 --> 20:39.190
sorry for the kerfuffle.

20:39.190 --> 20:39.790
Everyone,

20:39.800 --> 20:40.600
my apologies.

20:40.710 --> 20:41.580
Enjoy yourselves.

20:41.580 --> 20:42.980
Take your time and enjoy.

20:46.080 --> 20:47.190
There you are, sir.

20:52.990 --> 20:54.270
What happened to your face?

20:54.270 --> 20:55.230
Nothing.

20:55.260 --> 20:56.570
Put your hand down.

20:58.560 --> 20:59.820
Turn your face around.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.560
You're badly hurt.

21:07.920 --> 21:09.430
This time, for what?

21:10.080 --> 21:11.320
I accidentally

21:11.430 --> 21:13.430
broke a customer's item yesterday.

21:13.450 --> 21:14.680
I deserved the beating.

21:14.680 --> 21:16.290
Enjoy yourself, sir.

21:16.740 --> 21:17.650
Wait.

21:22.840 --> 21:24.120
This is my address.

21:24.290 --> 21:26.950
If you're done with being beaten here
every day,

21:27.720 --> 21:29.000
then come find me.

21:34.230 --> 21:35.190
By the way...

21:36.120 --> 21:37.190
Can you read?

21:38.430 --> 21:39.800
No, I can't.

21:40.640 --> 21:42.440
Then have the note read to you.

21:47.560 --> 21:48.490
Get me the check!

21:48.880 --> 21:49.950
Yes, sir!

21:52.030 --> 21:53.160
Three copper coins.

21:57.310 --> 21:58.380
The next day,

21:58.710 --> 22:00.030
I made up my mind

22:00.600 --> 22:01.950
and went to that address

22:02.100 --> 22:03.700
to meet with the Sect Master.

22:07.320 --> 22:08.160
Silly Liang!

22:09.080 --> 22:09.880
Yes, Sect Master.

22:09.880 --> 22:10.990
You made contributions too.

22:10.990 --> 22:12.030
Care to join us for a drink?

22:12.030 --> 22:12.600
No,

22:12.600 --> 22:12.990
Sect Master.

22:12.990 --> 22:14.360
I'm not fit to sit at that table.

22:14.360 --> 22:16.020
Enjoy yourself, Sect Master.

22:16.750 --> 22:17.670
What a kid.

22:19.060 --> 22:20.720
Oh my, that was quite a fright.

22:37.640 --> 22:39.300
Everyone, let's call it a day.

22:41.160 --> 22:41.690
Let's go.

22:44.950 --> 22:45.880
What's going on?

22:46.190 --> 22:48.120
Must be those vile creatures
from the Plum Blossom Sect again.

22:48.120 --> 22:49.710
They've been pulling stunts
everywhere lately,

22:49.710 --> 22:51.710
cooking up some sort of crap miracle

22:51.730 --> 22:53.660
and stealing much of our business.

22:54.160 --> 22:55.270
What miracle?

22:56.750 --> 22:58.810
The ascension of immortal children.

24:11.880 --> 24:14.840
Immortal child, please get on
the heavenly ladder.

25:01.430 --> 25:03.420
Look, the immortal child
is ascending to the sky!

25:03.420 --> 25:04.930
The immortal child
is ascending to the sky!

25:04.930 --> 25:07.330
The immortal child
is ascending to the sky!

25:11.010 --> 25:14.120
Thank you, Master!

25:27.360 --> 25:30.080
The merits are accomplished.

25:30.880 --> 25:32.950
You will be relieved of three sufferings.

25:32.950 --> 25:35.310
Blessings shall extend
to you and your kin.

25:35.310 --> 25:38.510
The plum blossoms open the holy path!

25:44.990 --> 25:45.750
Liang,

25:46.080 --> 25:47.610
is it really that mystical?

25:48.320 --> 25:50.180
Could you take me there for a look?

25:50.270 --> 25:50.950
No way.

25:50.950 --> 25:51.640
The Sect Master said

25:51.640 --> 25:53.950
that you must stay strictly
within Tianxiang Sect.

25:53.950 --> 25:55.380
I know how to break up this scam.

25:55.380 --> 25:56.550
Come on, give it a rest.

25:56.550 --> 25:57.920
Even these many Batous can't figure a way.

25:57.920 --> 25:59.520
What makes you think you can?

26:00.160 --> 26:00.990
Liang,

26:01.430 --> 26:03.430
when you first saw them
casting the ritual,

26:03.430 --> 26:05.800
was it around the first day
of the lunar month?

26:05.800 --> 26:06.560
How did you know that?

26:06.560 --> 26:07.600
Think about it.

26:08.080 --> 26:09.120
There were barely any stars

26:09.120 --> 26:10.720
in the sky that night, right?

26:11.430 --> 26:12.360
Yes, exactly.

26:12.880 --> 26:15.010
If we solve this difficulty, you'll be

26:15.190 --> 26:17.950
deemed to have made a major contribution
by the Sect Master.

26:17.950 --> 26:19.230
Perhaps by then,

26:19.670 --> 26:21.160
I'll even have to call you

26:21.540 --> 26:22.850
grandmaster.

26:38.920 --> 26:40.580
I'd like to hear you say it now.

26:41.810 --> 26:43.300
Not before we get the job done.

26:43.300 --> 26:44.020
Buddy,

26:44.210 --> 26:45.610
thank you for helping me.

26:45.630 --> 26:47.130
Let me treat you to candied haws.

26:47.130 --> 26:47.810
One bite for me.

26:47.810 --> 26:48.740
One bite for you.

26:49.080 --> 26:49.950
If I do become a Batou

26:49.950 --> 26:51.080
when this is done,

26:51.080 --> 26:51.840
I'll treat you to meat.

26:51.840 --> 26:52.600
Still, one bite for me,

26:52.600 --> 26:53.430
and one bite for you.

26:53.430 --> 26:54.560
Come on, have a bite.

26:56.560 --> 26:59.160
One handcuff for you
and one for me as well, huh?

26:59.600 --> 27:01.400
I have my cut, and you have yours.

27:01.730 --> 27:02.680
Fine then.

27:07.950 --> 27:09.080
The one performing the ritual

27:09.080 --> 27:11.940
should be Mei Xuanzi,
head of the Plum Blossom Sect.

27:50.810 --> 27:52.090
Behold,

27:52.190 --> 27:55.120
the immortal child
is to ascend the heavenly ladder.

28:39.740 --> 28:40.580
How insolent!

28:40.720 --> 28:41.730
Who are you devil creature

28:41.730 --> 28:43.870
to stop the immortal child's ascension?

28:43.870 --> 28:44.790
Take him down!

28:52.200 --> 28:53.000
Move aside!

28:53.020 --> 28:53.850
Move!

29:03.160 --> 29:03.990
Get down here!

29:04.670 --> 29:05.800
Come down right now!

29:06.370 --> 29:07.370
Leave the ladder!

29:30.080 --> 29:31.740
There was a balloon attached.

29:35.190 --> 29:36.720
You have all been deceived.

29:37.990 --> 29:39.190
They drug the children

29:39.190 --> 29:40.510
and tie them to a balloon

29:40.510 --> 29:42.990
with a black thread
while they are unconscious.

29:42.990 --> 29:44.340
As the children climb up,

29:44.340 --> 29:46.120
the balloon will carry them
high in the sky

29:46.120 --> 29:48.180
only for them to fall to their deaths.

29:48.650 --> 29:50.210
My little boy!

30:15.880 --> 30:16.990
What is this about?

30:17.680 --> 30:19.360
We will take the money.

30:20.230 --> 30:21.960
By the code of this line of work,

30:22.160 --> 30:23.510
he who wrecks my setup

30:23.710 --> 30:25.240
must have his tongue cut out

30:25.470 --> 30:27.190
and be expelled from the sect he's in.

30:27.190 --> 30:28.080
Sect Master,

30:28.670 --> 30:31.470
will you do it, or shall my men do it?

30:32.190 --> 30:34.470
Master Mei, this is not right.

30:34.990 --> 30:36.320
Laying down rules

30:36.640 --> 30:37.950
at my own place...

30:38.360 --> 30:39.840
It's inappropriate, isn't it?

30:39.840 --> 30:40.950
Let me tell you

30:40.950 --> 30:42.550
the rules of Tianxiang Sect.

30:42.950 --> 30:45.010
Subjecting the people to suffering,

30:45.230 --> 30:46.490
separating families,

30:46.710 --> 30:48.080
and harming children

30:48.840 --> 30:50.230
are not to be tolerated.

30:50.950 --> 30:52.010
Is this your stance

30:52.230 --> 30:53.830
on this matter, Sect Master?

30:54.510 --> 30:56.560
Today, you must hand this person over,

30:56.560 --> 30:58.030
or I'll turn the entire Tianxiang Sect

30:58.030 --> 30:59.880
upside down!

31:05.310 --> 31:06.520
I don't believe it.

31:09.670 --> 31:12.000
Let me see which of you
dares to make a move.

31:13.920 --> 31:14.850
You.

31:19.900 --> 31:20.790
You.

31:25.930 --> 31:27.060
Who else?

31:31.750 --> 31:33.120
Stop playing tricks.

31:36.800 --> 31:38.080
And you.

31:42.360 --> 31:43.360
Oh, that broken chair of mine.

31:43.360 --> 31:44.710
It caused you to fall.

31:44.840 --> 31:45.880
Come on.

31:46.000 --> 31:47.050
Get up now.

31:47.090 --> 31:47.980
Let me see.

31:48.270 --> 31:49.420
Are you alright?

31:52.030 --> 31:53.830
Anything else you'd like to say?

31:54.840 --> 31:55.880
Sect Master,

31:55.880 --> 31:57.800
our paths will cross again.

31:58.190 --> 32:00.450
We'll have plenty of time to settle this.

32:00.840 --> 32:03.170
Goodbye and take care.
I won't see you out.

32:21.670 --> 32:22.230
Sir.

32:26.180 --> 32:27.220
Stop watching.

32:27.510 --> 32:28.770
Come out here, you two.

32:30.880 --> 32:32.920
The two of you did put on quite a show.

32:33.120 --> 32:35.880
The Plum Blossom Sect
has been completely humiliated.

32:35.880 --> 32:37.160
Rescuing the innocent

32:37.600 --> 32:39.460
and helping families reunite...

32:39.880 --> 32:40.940
That's a good deed.

32:41.430 --> 32:42.630
You deserve rewards.

32:44.400 --> 32:46.120
That said, in Tianxiang Sect, the code

32:46.120 --> 32:48.950
has always been to reward merit
and punish fault without ambiguity.

32:48.950 --> 32:50.320
Rewards and punishments

32:50.320 --> 32:51.510
will be given fairly.

32:51.510 --> 32:52.840
Is it correct, Silly Liang?

32:52.840 --> 32:53.320
Yes.

32:54.510 --> 32:56.320
Sect Master, I know I did wrong.

32:56.560 --> 32:57.470
What did you do wrong?

32:57.470 --> 32:58.800
I left my post without permission.

32:58.800 --> 33:00.060
I also took the liberty

33:00.080 --> 33:01.600
of letting Shangguan Chengming
out of the sect.

33:01.600 --> 33:03.800
I disobeyed your orders, Sect Master.

33:04.710 --> 33:06.470
What should we do with you then?

33:06.560 --> 33:07.670
You have to be punished, right?

33:07.670 --> 33:09.840
Sir, I'm truly sorry for what I did.

33:09.990 --> 33:11.360
I won't take the gold.

33:11.360 --> 33:13.640
I only beg you for a chance
to make things right.

33:13.640 --> 33:15.100
Please spare my life, sir.

33:15.190 --> 33:17.640
You were always eager to foil
the Plum Blossom Sect's scheme.

33:17.640 --> 33:18.970
Liang's doing actually

33:19.030 --> 33:21.290
brought honor to Tianxiang Sect, right?

33:22.560 --> 33:23.230
Besides,

33:23.710 --> 33:25.640
I came back here already, didn't I?

33:25.800 --> 33:27.430
You do have a point.

33:28.430 --> 33:29.360
Tell you what?

33:29.750 --> 33:31.430
I'll do Chengming a favor.

33:32.270 --> 33:33.160
Get up, Liang.

33:34.950 --> 33:35.810
Thank you, sir.

33:37.950 --> 33:38.990
I'll also give you

33:38.990 --> 33:41.120
a chance to mend your ways.

33:41.750 --> 33:42.990
The Plum Blossom Sect

33:42.990 --> 33:44.670
has been in the limelight lately.

33:44.670 --> 33:46.400
I can't just sit back and watch.

33:46.470 --> 33:48.230
I plan to hold a ceremony

33:48.400 --> 33:49.800
and make it a big one,

33:49.800 --> 33:51.670
so as to let the whole world know

33:51.670 --> 33:53.840
that Tianxiang Sect reigns supreme.

33:54.320 --> 33:55.120
I now trust you

33:55.400 --> 33:56.260
with this task.

33:56.670 --> 33:57.600
Sir, I'm sorry for what I did.

33:57.600 --> 33:58.470
Sir,

33:58.470 --> 34:00.750
I-I-I am really not up for the task.

34:01.560 --> 34:03.690
Look at you, having no ambition at all.

34:03.920 --> 34:05.510
It's just a ceremony, isn't it?

34:05.510 --> 34:06.190
Liang.

34:07.580 --> 34:08.380
I'll help you.

34:35.760 --> 34:38.070
You lot have caused
quite a stir this time.

34:38.070 --> 34:39.530
Those children's parents

34:39.550 --> 34:41.949
are now complaining to the police station.

34:48.239 --> 34:50.630
We will compensate those families.

34:50.760 --> 34:51.880
Director,

34:52.030 --> 34:53.630
could you please do us a favor

34:53.679 --> 34:54.940
and let this one slide?

34:55.760 --> 34:57.320
Do people in the Plum Blossom Sect

34:57.320 --> 34:59.110
only buy one shoe at a time?

35:00.110 --> 35:01.040
I got it. I got it.

35:01.280 --> 35:02.680
It takes a group to form a gang.

35:02.680 --> 35:04.070
Good things should come in pairs.

35:04.070 --> 35:05.070
Here is

35:05.280 --> 35:06.430
the other shoe.

35:10.880 --> 35:11.880
That's more like it.

35:11.880 --> 35:13.760
Who in Yucheng doesn't know how hard

35:13.760 --> 35:15.950
you've worked and how much
you've contributed, Director Fan?

35:15.950 --> 35:17.200
You're holding up half

35:17.200 --> 35:19.330
of the city by yourself, Director Fan.

35:19.800 --> 35:21.070
This time, Tianxiang Sect

35:21.070 --> 35:22.630
humiliated us in front of many

35:22.630 --> 35:24.320
and made us suffer a great loss.

35:24.320 --> 35:26.070
If you could kindly help us—

35:26.070 --> 35:27.320
You want to get even?

35:27.840 --> 35:30.200
Tianxiang Sect is powerful
and has many disciples.

35:30.200 --> 35:31.860
They are not to be messed with.

35:31.990 --> 35:33.320
Man schemes a thousand ways,

35:33.320 --> 35:34.920
but Heaven has the final say.

35:34.950 --> 35:36.920
From now on, 80%
of the Plum Blossom Sect's profits

35:36.920 --> 35:37.840
will be yours.

35:39.200 --> 35:39.990
Well then...

35:41.360 --> 35:42.440
wait to hear from me.

35:42.440 --> 35:43.520
Sure.

35:47.070 --> 35:47.670
Director,

35:48.240 --> 35:49.900
don't forget about the stuff.

35:51.200 --> 35:52.400
As a public servant,

35:52.590 --> 35:54.400
I stay clear of gold and silver.

35:54.680 --> 35:56.800
You just pay for the tea today.

36:18.590 --> 36:19.200
Director,

36:19.200 --> 36:21.070
the Plum Blossom Sect case is closed.

36:21.070 --> 36:22.150
They'd like to offer you

36:22.150 --> 36:23.550
a token of appreciation.

36:29.630 --> 36:30.360
Is this all?

36:31.510 --> 36:32.770
This is all of the gift.

36:36.550 --> 36:38.810
I had a meeting with the superiors today.

36:38.920 --> 36:41.280
They want me to be
the deputy corps commander.

36:41.280 --> 36:43.280
I will highly recommend you to them,

36:44.550 --> 36:45.200
so you can

36:45.510 --> 36:46.770
take over my position.

36:46.800 --> 36:47.720
Director,

36:48.840 --> 36:50.700
please spare me all this testing.

36:50.990 --> 36:52.320
They're transferring you

36:52.320 --> 36:53.990
only to put their own people in.

36:53.990 --> 36:55.200
I swear to God that I've never

36:55.200 --> 36:57.260
thought about taking your position.

36:57.630 --> 36:59.400
It is my greatest blessing

37:00.030 --> 37:01.960
to be your subordinate all my life.

37:04.550 --> 37:06.950
That post of deputy corps commander
is just a figurehead.

37:06.950 --> 37:08.880
It sounds like a promotion in rank,

37:09.430 --> 37:12.240
but it comes with little real power.

37:12.840 --> 37:14.150
But if I refuse it,

37:14.150 --> 37:15.950
I might not get

37:15.950 --> 37:17.610
a better chance in the future.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.530
I really have no idea

37:21.070 --> 37:23.720
if this is a blessing or a curse.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.000
Director,

37:27.590 --> 37:28.510
don't fret.

37:28.990 --> 37:31.590
How about asking a master
to tell your fortune?

37:32.280 --> 37:33.880
I'd love to do some divination.

37:33.880 --> 37:34.470
But

37:34.590 --> 37:36.850
there are too few real masters nowadays.

37:37.920 --> 37:38.950
Meanwhile,

37:39.800 --> 37:40.840
frauds prevail.

37:41.150 --> 37:42.110
That's right.

37:43.920 --> 37:44.630
Director,

37:44.760 --> 37:47.360
There is an amazing fortune teller
in Yucheng,

37:47.840 --> 37:49.770
famous throughout the southwest.

37:50.400 --> 37:51.320
Do you know him?

37:53.400 --> 37:55.400
I haven't had any dealings with him,

37:55.400 --> 37:56.800
but I can find him.

37:57.320 --> 37:59.070
If he dares to scam you...

37:59.070 --> 38:00.150
I'll finish him off

38:00.920 --> 38:02.630
before you even lift a finger.

38:05.510 --> 38:06.310
Alright then.

38:18.110 --> 38:18.590
Sir.

38:22.150 --> 38:22.880
How do I look?

38:23.200 --> 38:23.760
Great.

38:24.030 --> 38:25.360
They were made in America.

38:25.360 --> 38:25.960
So classy.

38:28.200 --> 38:28.760
I called for you.

38:28.760 --> 38:29.990
What took you so long?

38:30.200 --> 38:31.280
I got up early

38:31.510 --> 38:33.040
to visit my mother's grave.

38:33.990 --> 38:35.030
I was too busy before

38:35.030 --> 38:35.950
to have time for that.

38:35.950 --> 38:38.430
Did you say how you've been
at your mother's grave?

38:38.430 --> 38:39.070
Yes, I did.

38:41.070 --> 38:43.150
I had you come over just to ask you

38:43.360 --> 38:46.110
how Shangguan Chengming is doing lately.

38:47.470 --> 38:48.150
You've really

38:48.150 --> 38:50.400
sent him on an impossible mission.

38:50.590 --> 38:52.030
He's not even a member of our sect.

38:52.030 --> 38:53.230
No one listens to him.

38:53.280 --> 38:54.010
That's good.

38:54.800 --> 38:57.200
Only in this way
will he figure out his position.

38:57.200 --> 38:59.530
Sir, you've put a lot of thought
into this,

38:59.550 --> 39:00.510
but I doubt

39:00.840 --> 39:01.950
if this kid will

39:02.400 --> 39:04.060
understand your intentions.

39:04.510 --> 39:06.170
Let things take their course.

39:07.070 --> 39:07.760
Sit.

39:09.720 --> 39:11.250
I'd like to take this chance

39:11.360 --> 39:12.890
to report something to you.

39:13.110 --> 39:14.170
We've got a new job.

39:14.470 --> 39:16.030
Director Wang of the police bureau seems

39:16.030 --> 39:18.240
to have been given a chance at promotion.

39:18.240 --> 39:19.970
He would like to invite you over

39:20.150 --> 39:21.880
to tell his fortune, probably.

39:22.840 --> 39:23.770
You mean Wang...

39:24.430 --> 39:25.290
Wang Zhicheng?

39:25.550 --> 39:26.070
Yes.

39:26.400 --> 39:28.800
Haven't you always wanted to befriend him?

39:29.280 --> 39:31.280
I think this is a great opportunity.

39:31.360 --> 39:33.490
Here is all the information about him.

39:34.110 --> 39:35.070
Did you get this?

39:35.360 --> 39:36.280
Fan Jialie gave it to me.

39:36.280 --> 39:39.280
Director Wang also had him
send the invitation to you.

39:40.400 --> 39:40.880
I think...

39:40.880 --> 39:41.590
Hold on.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.650
Something's not right.

39:46.400 --> 39:49.470
Shortly after we ruined
the Plum Blossom Sect's setup,

39:50.510 --> 39:52.280
Fan Jialie...

39:54.680 --> 39:55.510
Could this...

39:56.110 --> 39:57.430
be a trap?

39:57.990 --> 39:59.120
Every year, our sect

39:59.360 --> 40:01.220
has never been short a single cent

40:01.510 --> 40:02.680
of the money for Fan Jialie.

40:02.680 --> 40:04.410
This matter is not that simple.

40:09.840 --> 40:10.840
Then how about...

40:11.800 --> 40:12.730
I turn this down?

40:16.430 --> 40:18.960
Why would we turn away
a business opportunity

40:19.990 --> 40:22.030
delivered right to our door?

40:22.810 --> 40:26.380
[Shunxiang Teahouse]

40:39.990 --> 40:41.190
You achieved success

40:41.510 --> 40:42.710
at 29, Director Wang.

40:42.880 --> 40:44.590
That was because you nearly

40:45.070 --> 40:46.360
lost your life at 28.

40:46.590 --> 40:48.800
So, surviving a great disaster actually

40:48.800 --> 40:50.400
brings good fortune, right?

40:52.510 --> 40:54.710
You are destined to be with three women.

40:54.800 --> 40:55.590
That's true.

40:56.070 --> 40:56.930
I just recently

40:57.150 --> 40:58.200
took a third woman.

40:58.200 --> 40:59.260
Congratulations.

41:03.280 --> 41:04.630
Anything wrong?

41:05.470 --> 41:07.990
This promotion is an obstacle
in your career.

41:07.990 --> 41:10.450
You might lose your official post
next year.

41:10.630 --> 41:12.160
Astrologically speaking,

41:12.400 --> 41:13.800
your prospects are vast.

41:14.240 --> 41:15.760
But the obstacle next year

41:18.630 --> 41:21.200
is likely related to feng shui.

41:21.880 --> 41:23.150
May I ask

41:23.920 --> 41:28.030
if your residence is next to
waters and trees?

41:28.590 --> 41:29.990
Shouldn't that be good feng shui?

41:29.990 --> 41:30.760
It should be.

41:30.760 --> 41:32.880
But I'm afraid the big trees might be

41:32.880 --> 41:35.680
blocking the waters
before the doors and windows.

41:36.150 --> 41:37.350
As the ancients said,

41:37.550 --> 41:39.030
a single leaf can obscure the view.

41:39.030 --> 41:40.470
For ordinary folks, it's no big deal

41:40.470 --> 41:42.800
for trees to cast their shade
on the river.

41:43.070 --> 41:44.110
But for you, Director Wang,

41:44.110 --> 41:45.800
a man with vast prospects,

41:45.990 --> 41:47.150
that's a hindrance.

41:47.950 --> 41:49.210
Don't worry, though.,

41:49.400 --> 41:50.760
I'll adjust the feng shui for you.

41:50.760 --> 41:52.760
You truly are a master, sir.

42:11.110 --> 42:12.710
Thank you for your hard work.

42:13.880 --> 42:15.010
Please accept this.

42:34.030 --> 42:35.110
Sir,

42:36.550 --> 42:38.630
why don't you take the money?

42:40.030 --> 42:42.360
It's an honor to be of your service,
Director Wang.

42:42.360 --> 42:43.840
How can I take your money?

42:47.110 --> 42:48.070
I'm leaving.

42:50.510 --> 42:51.320
Guards!

43:01.020 --> 43:02.680
What's this supposed to mean?

43:04.430 --> 43:05.720
You're not much

43:06.510 --> 43:08.370
of a good fortune teller, are you?

43:08.640 --> 43:11.360
Every word you said was pure nonsense.

43:12.360 --> 43:12.950
Director Wang,

43:12.950 --> 43:14.680
he's just a charlatan,

43:14.880 --> 43:16.280
a big fraud!

43:16.590 --> 43:17.510
Take him down!

43:20.550 --> 43:22.630
To distinguish right from wrong is wisdom;

43:22.630 --> 43:24.990
to invert them is folly.

43:25.070 --> 43:26.950
Put it in a way I can understand.

43:27.110 --> 43:27.760
Fine.

43:28.750 --> 43:30.810
I'll do three final readings for you.

43:30.840 --> 43:31.630
Great then.

43:33.510 --> 43:35.280
Proceed right now.

43:35.550 --> 43:37.110
If the results turn out to be accurate,

43:37.110 --> 43:37.880
I'll let you go.

43:37.880 --> 43:38.840
But if not,

43:39.240 --> 43:40.240
I'll shoot you dead

43:40.240 --> 43:41.470
on the spot!

43:45.720 --> 43:47.950
[In the next episode]

43:48.070 --> 43:50.630
I'll deal with him sooner or later.

43:48.130 --> 43:50.560
[The show begins]

43:50.880 --> 43:52.240
He's still too young.

43:52.280 --> 43:54.030
How is the preparation for the ritual

43:54.030 --> 43:55.470
to lead the dead to rebirth going?

43:55.470 --> 43:58.070
Set up the alter.

43:59.630 --> 44:00.200
Liang,

44:00.200 --> 44:01.950
can we skip it today?

44:01.950 --> 44:04.030
It's an important task.
I must take it head on.

44:04.030 --> 44:05.590
I'm afraid the Plum Blossom Sect
will come mess with us.

44:05.590 --> 44:08.050
If you're fear death,
go home and raise pigs.

44:08.920 --> 44:10.120
May my son

44:10.360 --> 44:12.470
be healthy

44:12.630 --> 44:14.430
and live a life free of illness.

44:20.430 --> 44:21.190
Liang.

44:22.590 --> 44:23.400
Liang.

44:24.760 --> 44:25.550
No way.
